# Gold Pan: "Equip {1}" attaches to a creature you control, only as a sorcery (CR 702.6a, 301.5): not while its enters trigger is
# on the stack (refused) nor, with an untapped Mox Pearl to pay and an Ornithopter to attach to, while Bot2's Ornithopter spell is on the
# stack during Bot2's turn (refused; the same equip is made at Bot1's own main phase on turn 3, the positive control), and not to Bot2's Ornithopter (not offered as a target). The Treasure pays for the first equip on turn 1;
# on turn 3 Bot1 moves it to the other Ornithopter with a Mox, and the first goes back to 0/2 while the second becomes 1/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Gold Pan
Mox Pearl
Swamp
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Swamp x6
Swamp x10

